{"title":"Career Roadmap · Test Engineer","role":"Test Engineer","summary":"A Test Engineer verifies that software applications work correctly, reliably, securely, and according to requirements. The role involves designing test cases, executing tests, identifying defects, reproducing failures, validating fixes, and increasingly automating repetitive testing.","facts":{"Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Software Testing / QA"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Test Engineer verifies that software applications work correctly, reliably, securely, and according to requirements. The role involves designing test cases, executing tests, identifying defects, reproducing failures, validating fixes, and increasingly automating repetitive testing."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA – Software Testing / QA graduate, this is a direct career pathway. The student should develop both software-testing fundamentals and programming ability, because modern QA increasingly combines manual testing with automation, APIs, CI/CD, cloud environments, and quality engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest entry-level profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Manual Testing","SQL","API Testing","Programming","Automation","Git","CI/CD"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Foundation & Entry"},{"text":"QA Intern → Test Engineer / QA Engineer"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Automation & Specialization"},{"text":"Automation Engineer → Senior QA Engineer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Technical Leadership"},{"text":"Lead QA / SDET / Quality Engineering Lead"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Architecture & Management"},{"text":"QA Manager / Test Architect / Head of Quality"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BCA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Programming & Software Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"The first year should establish the technical foundation required to understand how software is developed and tested."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary language for automation:"},{"type":"p","text":"Java is an excellent choice because of its large automation ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"Object-oriented programming"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Exception handling"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"Collections"},{"text":"Debugging"},{"text":"Basic algorithms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Science Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operating systems"},{"text":"Computer networks"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"SDLC"},{"text":"Basic web technologies"},{"text":"Client-server architecture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Testing fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is software testing?"},{"text":"QA vs QC"},{"text":"Verification vs validation"},{"text":"SDLC"},{"text":"STLC"},{"text":"Test levels"},{"text":"Test types"},{"text":"Defect lifecycle"},{"text":"Test planning"},{"text":"Test execution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Manual Testing & Database Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should become comfortable with professional QA workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Manual Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Test scenarios"},{"text":"Test cases"},{"text":"Test data"},{"text":"Test execution"},{"text":"Defect reporting"},{"text":"Regression testing"},{"text":"Smoke testing"},{"text":"Sanity testing"},{"text":"Functional testing"},{"text":"Integration testing"},{"text":"System testing"},{"text":"Acceptance testing"},{"text":"Exploratory testing"},{"text":"Compatibility testing"},{"text":"Usability testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Test Case Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equivalence partitioning"},{"text":"Boundary value analysis"},{"text":"Decision tables"},{"text":"State transition testing"},{"text":"Error guessing"},{"text":"Pairwise testing basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Defect Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Severity"},{"text":"Priority"},{"text":"Defect lifecycle"},{"text":"Reproducibility"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Defect reports"},{"text":"Regression verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL & Database Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL is extremely important for a Test Engineer."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"ORDER BY"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"HAVING"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"Subqueries"},{"type":"p","text":"CTEs"},{"type":"p","text":"Aggregate functions"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"Indexes"},{"type":"p","text":"Views"},{"type":"p","text":"Transactions"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice validating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Database records"},{"text":"Insert/update/delete operations"},{"text":"Data consistency"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Stored procedures"},{"text":"API-to-database flows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A user places an online order:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Frontend","API","Backend","Database"]},{"type":"p","text":"The tester should verify that the transaction is correctly reflected across the entire flow."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Automation & API Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the transition from traditional QA to modern engineering-oriented testing."},{"type":"h","text":"Web Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a major framework."},{"type":"h","text":"Java route"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Selenium"},{"text":"TestNG"},{"text":"JUnit"},{"text":"Maven"},{"text":"Page Object Model"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python route"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Selenium"},{"text":"PyTest"},{"text":"Playwright"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Modern alternative"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Playwright"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Playwright is particularly useful for modern web application testing."},{"type":"h","text":"Automation Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Locators"},{"text":"XPath"},{"text":"CSS selectors"},{"text":"Browser automation"},{"text":"Assertions"},{"text":"Wait strategies"},{"text":"Page Object Model"},{"text":"Data-driven testing"},{"text":"Parameterization"},{"text":"Test suites"},{"text":"Screenshots"},{"text":"Reports"},{"text":"Parallel execution"},{"text":"Test configuration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Framework Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a framework like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Test Cases","Page Objects","Utilities","Test Data","Configuration","Reports"]},{"type":"h","text":"API Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"API testing is essential for modern Test Engineers."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTTP"},{"text":"REST"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"XML basics"},{"text":"HTTP methods"},{"text":"Status codes"},{"text":"Headers"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":"Request/response validation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Postman"},{"text":"Newman"},{"text":"REST Assured"},{"text":"Playwright API testing"},{"text":"Python requests"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Test:"},{"type":"p","text":"GET"},{"type":"p","text":"POST"},{"type":"p","text":"PUT"},{"type":"p","text":"PATCH"},{"type":"p","text":"DELETE"},{"type":"p","text":"Validate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Status code"},{"text":"Response body"},{"text":"Schema"},{"text":"Headers"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"Database impact"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — CI/CD & Quality Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"The final stage should focus on integrating testing into software delivery."},{"type":"p","text":"If the BCA is a 3-year program, compress this stage into the final semester and internship."},{"type":"h","text":"Git & Version Control"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub/GitLab"},{"text":"Branching"},{"text":"Pull requests"},{"text":"Merge conflicts"},{"text":"Code review"},{"text":".gitignore"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CI/CD"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Continuous Integration"},{"text":"Continuous Delivery"},{"text":"Continuous Deployment"},{"text":"Automated test execution"},{"text":"Build pipelines"},{"text":"Test reports"},{"text":"Release gates"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Jenkins"},{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"GitLab CI/CD"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A useful pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Developer Push","Build","Unit Tests","API Tests","UI Automation","Test Report","Deployment"]},{"type":"h","text":"Container & Cloud Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic:"},{"type":"h","text":"Docker"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Images"},{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Dockerfile"},{"text":"Docker Compose"},{"text":"Containerized testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud application architecture"},{"text":"Virtual machines"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Networking basics"},{"text":"Logs"},{"text":"Monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Test Engineer does not need to become a cloud engineer, but should understand the environments where applications are deployed."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong QA portfolio should demonstrate testing methodology and automation, not just application development."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — E-Commerce Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Login"},{"text":"Product search"},{"text":"Product filtering"},{"text":"Cart"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Payments"},{"text":"Order history"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Test plan"},{"text":"Test cases"},{"text":"Defect reports"},{"text":"Regression suite"},{"text":"Automation framework"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — REST API Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Create or use a sample backend and test:"},{"type":"p","text":"Authentication"},{"type":"p","text":"Users"},{"type":"p","text":"Products"},{"type":"p","text":"Orders"},{"type":"p","text":"Payments"},{"type":"p","text":"Automate API tests using:"},{"type":"h","text":"Postman/Newman or REST Assured"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Selenium/Playwright Automation Framework"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a reusable framework containing:"},{"type":"p","text":"Page Objects"},{"type":"p","text":"Test Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Configuration"},{"type":"p","text":"Utilities"},{"type":"p","text":"Assertions"},{"type":"p","text":"Logging"},{"type":"p","text":"Screenshots"},{"type":"p","text":"Reports"},{"type":"p","text":"Run it automatically through GitHub Actions or Jenkins."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Banking/FinTech Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Because the specialization is software testing, a domain project can demonstrate additional business understanding."},{"type":"p","text":"Test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Account creation"},{"text":"Login"},{"text":"Fund transfer"},{"text":"Transaction history"},{"text":"Payment failure"},{"text":"Invalid transactions"},{"text":"Session timeout"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":"Transaction limits"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include positive and negative test scenarios."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — End-to-End Quality Engineering Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application","Manual Test Cases","API Tests","UI Automation","Database Validation","Git","CI/CD","Automated Reports"]},{"type":"p","text":"This should become the primary portfolio project."},{"type":"h","text":"Agile & Scrum"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern Test Engineers usually work inside Agile teams."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scrum"},{"text":"Sprint"},{"text":"Product backlog"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"},{"text":"Daily stand-up"},{"text":"Sprint planning"},{"text":"Sprint review"},{"text":"Retrospective"},{"text":"Definition of Done"},{"text":"Definition of Ready"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A tester should be able to convert a user story into meaningful test scenarios."},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"After mastering functional and automation testing, learn performance fundamentals."},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JMeter"},{"text":"k6"},{"text":"Gatling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Load testing"},{"text":"Stress testing"},{"text":"Spike testing"},{"text":"Endurance testing"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Throughput"},{"text":"Concurrent users"},{"text":"Bottleneck analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Performance testing can become a useful specialization later."},{"type":"h","text":"Security Testing Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"A Test Engineer should understand common application-security issues."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Authentication testing"},{"text":"Authorization testing"},{"text":"Session management"},{"text":"Input validation"},{"text":"SQL injection basics"},{"text":"XSS basics"},{"text":"CSRF basics"},{"text":"Sensitive-data exposure"},{"text":"OWASP Top 10"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This does not make the graduate a penetration tester, but it improves overall software quality awareness."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying during the second half of the degree."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QA Intern"},{"text":"Software Testing Intern"},{"text":"Test Engineer Intern"},{"text":"Automation Testing Intern"},{"text":"Quality Assurance Intern"},{"text":"SDET Intern"},{"text":"QA Automation Intern"},{"text":"API Testing Intern"},{"text":"Software Quality Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Prioritize internships involving"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manual testing"},{"text":"API testing"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Selenium/Playwright"},{"text":"Automation frameworks"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Real production applications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An internship that involves only repetitive manual execution is useful as a starting point, but the long-term objective should be automation and quality engineering."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After BCA, the graduate can target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Core QA"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Test Engineer"},{"text":"QA Engineer"},{"text":"Software Test Engineer"},{"text":"Quality Analyst"},{"text":"QA Analyst"},{"text":"Software Testing Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automation Test Engineer"},{"text":"QA Automation Engineer"},{"text":"Test Automation Engineer"},{"text":"Junior SDET"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"API Test Engineer"},{"text":"Mobile Test Engineer"},{"text":"Performance Testing Engineer"},{"text":"Database Test Engineer"},{"text":"Quality Engineering Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Manual testing"},{"text":"Test cases, scenarios, regression"}],[{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Selenium/Playwright"}],[{"text":"API testing"},{"text":"Postman, REST Assured"}],[{"text":"Database testing"},{"text":"SQL"}],[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Java/Python"}],[{"text":"Test frameworks"},{"text":"TestNG/JUnit/PyTest"}],[{"text":"Build tools"},{"text":"Maven/Gradle"}],[{"text":"Version control"},{"text":"Git"}],[{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Jenkins/GitHub Actions"}],[{"text":"Agile"},{"text":"Scrum"}],[{"text":"Defect tracking"},{"text":"Jira"}],[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Test reports, logs"}],[{"text":"Web testing"},{"text":"Browser DevTools"}],[{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"JMeter/k6"}],[{"text":"Security"},{"text":"OWASP fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"Basic AWS/Azure/GCP"}],[{"text":"Containers"},{"text":"Docker"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Tools to Learn"},{"type":"h","text":"Test Management / Defect Tracking"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Azure DevOps"},{"text":"TestRail or equivalent test-management tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Selenium"},{"text":"Playwright"},{"text":"TestNG/JUnit/PyTest"}]},{"type":"h","text":"API"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Postman"},{"text":"REST Assured"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CI/CD"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Jenkins"},{"text":"GitHub Actions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Maven"},{"text":"Gradle"},{"text":"VS Code / IntelliJ IDEA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Performance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JMeter"},{"text":"k6"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications can support the profile, but practical testing ability is more important."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful certification"},{"type":"h","text":"ISTQB Foundation Level (CTFL)"},{"type":"p","text":"It can help demonstrate structured knowledge of testing terminology and principles, particularly for an entry-level candidate."},{"type":"h","text":"Other learning priorities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Selenium/Playwright"},{"text":"API testing"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Java/Python"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Agile/Scrum"},{"text":"Docker"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not collect numerous testing certificates while lacking an automation portfolio."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not mandatory for becoming a Test Engineer."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible options include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"M.Sc Computer Science"},{"text":"M.Sc Software Engineering"},{"text":"M.Sc Information Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc Data/Computer Science-related programs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA IT"},{"text":"MBA Technology Management"},{"text":"MBA Operations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For most QA careers, professional experience and technical specialization can be more valuable than immediately pursuing a PG."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Career Specializations"},{"type":"p","text":"After gaining professional experience, the Test Engineer can specialize."},{"type":"h","text":"1. SDET"},{"type":"h","text":"Software Development Engineer in Test"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Automation frameworks"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"Test infrastructure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Test Engineer","Automation Engineer","SDET","Senior SDET","SDET Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Performance Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Load testing"},{"text":"Distributed systems"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Bottleneck identification"},{"text":"Performance optimization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["QA Engineer","Performance Engineer","Senior Performance Engineer","Performance Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Security Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Application security"},{"text":"API security"},{"text":"OWASP"},{"text":"Vulnerability testing"},{"text":"Secure development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["QA Engineer","Security Tester","Application Security Engineer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Additional security qualifications may be required for specialized security positions."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Mobile Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Android"},{"text":"iOS"},{"text":"Mobile automation"},{"text":"Device compatibility"},{"text":"Network testing"},{"text":"App performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Appium"},{"text":"Android Studio"},{"text":"Xcode basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Quality Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a broader modern direction."},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of testing only after development, the engineer becomes involved throughout:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirements","Design","Development","Testing","CI/CD","Production","Monitoring"]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical technical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","QA / Test Intern","Test Engineer","Automation Test Engineer","Senior QA / SDET","Lead SDET / QA Lead","QA Architect / Quality Engineering Lead","Principal Engineer / Head of Quality"]},{"type":"p","text":"A management route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Test Engineer","Senior QA Engineer","QA Lead","QA Manager","Senior QA Manager","Head of Quality Engineering"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern testing is increasingly influenced by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted test generation"},{"text":"AI-based test maintenance"},{"text":"Autonomous test agents"},{"text":"Visual regression testing"},{"text":"Self-healing automation"},{"text":"Continuous testing"},{"text":"Cloud testing"},{"text":"Containerized test environments"},{"text":"Observability"},{"text":"Synthetic monitoring"},{"text":"Shift-left testing"},{"text":"Shift-right testing"},{"text":"Production quality monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The important principle is that AI should assist test design and maintenance, while the engineer remains responsible for understanding requirements, risk, coverage, and business impact."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Core QA"},{"type":"p","text":"Manual Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Test Case Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Defect Management"},{"type":"p","text":"SDLC"},{"type":"p","text":"STLC"},{"type":"p","text":"Agile/Scrum"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"p","text":"Java or Python"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Git"},{"type":"p","text":"Linux"},{"type":"p","text":"HTML/CSS/JavaScript basics"},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Selenium"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"p","text":"Playwright"},{"type":"p","text":"TestNG/JUnit/PyTest"},{"type":"p","text":"Page Object Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Data-Driven Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"API"},{"type":"p","text":"REST"},{"type":"p","text":"HTTP"},{"type":"p","text":"JSON"},{"type":"p","text":"Postman"},{"type":"p","text":"REST Assured"},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Maven/Gradle"},{"type":"p","text":"CI/CD"},{"type":"p","text":"Jenkins/GitHub Actions"},{"type":"p","text":"Docker"},{"type":"p","text":"Cloud Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Performance Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Security Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Mobile Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Observability"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-assisted Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be capable of taking a new application and performing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirement Analysis","Test Planning","Test Case Design","Manual Testing","Defect Reporting","SQL Validation","API Testing","UI Automation","Regression Testing","CI/CD Integration","Test Reporting"]},{"type":"p","text":"The graduate should also have one reusable automation framework on GitHub, rather than only individual Selenium scripts."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"BCA – Software Testing / QA → Test Engineer is a direct and practical career pathway. The initial entry point can be manual QA, but the stronger long-term strategy is to progress toward Automation Testing, SDET, and Quality Engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal graduate profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Manual Testing","SQL","API Testing","Java/Python","Selenium/Playwright","Git","CI/CD","Agile"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination provides a stronger foundation for progressing from Test Engineer → Automation Engineer/SDET → Senior Engineer → QA Lead/Quality Engineering Lead, while keeping options open for performance, security, mobile, and cloud testing."}]}]}